  "name": "group",
  "description": "A foundational Rust library that defines abstract traits and utilities for elliptic curve group operations in cryptographic contexts. It provides standardized interfaces for prime-order and cofactor groups, enabling efficient scalar multiplication through windowed Non-Adjacent Form (w-NAF) and constant-time serialization. The crate is designed for interoperability across the zkcrypto ecosystem and maintains strict no-std compatibility for use in performance-critical and zero-knowledge environments.",
